($q$imam-abdulrahman$q$, null, $q$SA$q$, $q$hours$q$, 25, null, true, null, false, null, $q$[]$q$::jsonb, $q$التأخر من 7 إلى 10 دقائق يُسجل تأخير، وكل تأخيرين = ساعة غياب$q$, $q${"program_rules": [{"program": "السنة التحضيرية", "max_unexcused": 15, "max_absence": 25, "source": {"url": "https://www.iau.edu.sa/sites/default/files/resources/lqwd_ltnfydhy_wljry_lmnzm_lsyr_ldrs_0.pdf", "title": "القواعد التنفيذية والإجرائية المنظمة للدراسة ببرنامج السنة التحضيرية", "quote": "إذا تجاوزت نسبة غيابه (15%) ... (بدون عذر مقبول) ... إذا تجاوزت نسبة غيابه (25%) ... (بعذر وبدون عذر مقبول)"}}]}$q$::jsonb, $q$UNKNOWN - rules issued under the University of Dammam name (pre-2016); confirm current$q$, $q$[{"url": "https://www.iau.edu.sa/sites/default/files/resources/lqwd_ltnzymy_wljryy_lsyr_lkhtbrt_whdwr_lmhdrt_-_njlyzy_1.pdf", "title": "Organizing and Procedural Rules for Attending Classes and Exams - Imam Abdulrahman Bin Faisal University", "quote": "Acceptable excuses shall be included in the allowed absence rate, which does not exceed 25% of all lectures and practical classes in one semester ... A student is considered late if he/she comes 7 to 10 minutes late ... Two late marks become a one-hour absence."}]$q$::jsonb, $q$25% total; excused absences are INCLUDED in the 25%. 2 lates = 1 hour of absence. Preparatory year: 15% unexcused / 25% total. Old document (University of Dammam era).$q$),
